flowchart TD
    A[Latest stg_table_metadata] --> B[Create data_object_id]
    C[Latest stg_column_metadata] --> D[Create column_id and data_object_id]

    E[manual_table_definition] --> F[Create same table key]
    G[manual_column_definition] --> H[Create same column key]

    B --> I[Left join table metadata + manual definition]
    F --> I

    D --> J[Left join column metadata + manual definition]
    H --> J

    I --> K[Overwrite governance.dim_data_object]
    J --> L[Overwrite governance.dim_column]

    K --> M[Build rpt_data_dictionary_search]
    L --> M

    K --> N[Build rpt_missing_definition]
    L --> N

    F --> O[Build manual table orphan report]
    H --> P[Build manual column orphan report]
